These Python implementations reference the BSPg algorithm and the public
GreedyBSP implementation. Local changes include the contest input/output and
task model, heap-based score maintenance, branch splitting and grouping,
task merging, and scene-specific scheduling or input-reuse extensions;
the exact changes vary by file. They are not unmodified upstream releases.
The upstream copyright, author attribution, and Apache-2.0 terms are retained
to cover any adapted upstream code.

